{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Hard Work, Etc.","html":"<article id='sn46.153-164'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.153–164 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 46.153–164 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>16. Punabalakaraṇīyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>16. Another Chapter on Hard Work </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Punabalādisutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hard Work, Etc. </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>…pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Soḷasamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Uddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Balaṁ bījañca nāgo ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>rukkho kumbhena sūkiyā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ākāsena ca dve meghā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nāvā āgantukā nadīti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='expansion-instructions'><span class='root'>(Bojjhaṅgasaṁyuttassa balakaraṇīyavaggo rāgavasena vitthāretabbo.) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>(Tell in full as in SN 45.149–160, removal of greed version.) </span></p></article>"}
